RELATIONAL CONSTANT SUBSYSTEM — REFINED OPERATOR MAP
Typed SID modes, PED channels, RDG operator classes
===================================================
RELATIONAL DYNAMIC GgEOETRY (RDG)

A precise description in your RDG language:

The Relational Constant Subsystem is a typed operator 
calculus where each mathematical constant is treated 
as a generator of structural, interactional, or 
dynamical flux. SID modes classify origin, PED 
channels classify flux, and RDG operator classes 
classify the resulting operator. Evaluation is a 
functional over representation sets.

It is essentially a categorical typing system for 
constants, compatible with your RDG tri‑mode 
relational geometry.

