EXECUTION SEMANTICS
-------------------
Each constant is a typed operator produced by the coupling:

  (SID mode, PED channel) → (RDG operator, numerical value)

Examples:
  (S, Q) → (PhaseOp, π)
  (S, P) → (LinMap, e) or (SimOp, φ)
  (I, E) → (AsympOp, γ)
  (I, P) → (RenormOp, δ)
  (D, E) → (DirichletOp, ζ(3)) or (DistribOp, C₂)

Representation sets (series, products, integrals, limits) all evaluate
to the same real number under the corresponding EvalFunctional.

