COUPLING RULE (reminder)
------------------------
SID mode × PED channel  →  RDG operator  →  constant

The RDG operator is the functional that converts the structural
and dynamical inputs into a unique real number. Different
representations (series, products, integrals, limits) of the same
constant are equivalent under the associated evaluation functional.
